# The build context is an allowlist: only what the Dockerfile copies. The repo itself arrives as a bind
# mount at run time, so bundles, docs and eval data never enter an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!smalls/
!smalls_data/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.venv
.pytest_cache
# Secrets never enter the build context. Keep these last so no allow rule above can re-admit them.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
